('original:government--constitutional-amendments:government--constitutional-amendments--8',1,'{"question":"Why does the amendment process require broad support?","choices":["To make constitutional changes identical to ordinary bills","To give the president sole authority to alter the document","To allow one state to replace the entire Constitution","To balance the possibility of change with constitutional stability"],"answer":3,"explanation":""}'::jsonb,'b033cfdaa5157c89094316bbbdf0b545','official',NULL,NULL,'Constitutional Amendments'),
