('original:government--constitutional-amendments:government--constitutional-amendments--10',1,'{"question":"How did the Twelfth Amendment change the Electoral College process?","choices":["It replaced electors with a national popular vote","It required separate electoral votes for president and vice president","It gave each state exactly one electoral vote","It transferred all presidential selection to the Supreme Court"],"answer":1,"explanation":""}'::jsonb,'a22cd393f2d40d2f91b5b1d7c594acdb','official',NULL,NULL,'Constitutional Amendments'),
